web/public/overviews/

# skypounce rig and playtest build output
plugin/skypounce/**/*.smx
plugin/skypounce/**/*.log
plugin/skypounce/**/__pycache__/

# The 3D theatre, copied from the theatre spike by tools/sync-theatre.sh and never
# edited or committed here (docs/theatre-3d.md): the small same-origin set (viewer
# page, vendor scripts, sound worker, manifest) that ships with the site, and the
# heavy set (maps, models, sounds, ~3.8 GB) staged for R2 outside web/.
web/public/theatre/
theatre-assets/
